# The community feeds page became the homepage (feeds-homepage, lb-v80). The
# section is /#feeds; the tab, view and controls are query params
# (/?feed=market&view=all#feeds). A request's own fragment survives a redirect
# whose Location carries none, and the homepage's feeds controller still
# routes the old hashes, so a shared /feeds#market lands on the Marketplace
# tab and the nav cart's /feeds#market-cart opens the cart.
/feeds          /#feeds                 301
/feeds.html     /#feeds                 301

# The "Submit a Meetup" / "Meetups" page was folded into the Events tab
# (lb-v37). Old URLs land there directly.
/newevent       /?feed=events#feeds     301
/newevent.html  /?feed=events#feeds     301
/meetups        /?feed=events#feeds     301
/meetups.html   /?feed=events#feeds     301

# The merch storefront was folded into the Marketplace tab as its "Show
# Merch" section (lb-v48). /merch is a spoken URL, so it keeps working.
/merch          /?feed=market#feeds     301
/merch.html     /?feed=market#feeds     301
